### Replace selected / insert text to the editor
Evaluate *the cell below* first, then, select a text in the cell and press the button.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: false
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
With[{win = CurrentWindow[]},
  EventHandler[InputButton["Replace selected text"],
    Function[Null, 
      FrontSubmit[FrontEditorSelected["Set", "Yo"]];
    ]
  ]
] 

