.md
### Reading selected text
This is a bit more complicated, since it involves communication back to the Wolfram Kernel

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: false
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%

### Reading selected text
This is a bit more complicated, since it involves communication back to the Wolfram Kernel

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: false
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
With[{win = CurrentWindow[], cell = ResultCell[]},
  EventHandler[InputButton["Read selected text"], Function[Null, 
    
      Then[FrontFetchAsync[FrontEditorSelected["Get"]], Function[result,
      CellPrint[result 
        , "After"->cell];
      ]
    ]
  ]]
]

