### Read cliboard
This is sort of an experimental feature, that allows to read the content of a clipboard

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: false
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%

### Read cliboard
This is sort of an experimental feature, that allows to read the content of a clipboard

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: false
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
With[{win = CurrentWindow[], cell = ResultCell[]},
  EventHandler[InputButton["Read clipboard"], Function[Null, 
    
      Then[FrontFetchAsync[ReadClipboard[]], Function[result,
      CellPrint[result 
        , "After"->cell];
      ]
    ]
  ]]
]

